    },
    "description": "Valley Fishing Guides Ltd, established in 2000, is owned and operated by Clint Goyette. For over 19 years VFG has offered professionally guided fly fishing trips in Squamish, Whistler, and Pemberton. Guided full day, half day, multi-day and heli-fishing trips for salmon, rainbow trout, cutthroat trout, steelhead, and bull trout are offered year-round. The guiding team is composed of well trained guides local to the area. Clients are provided with the best in fly fishing equipment whether two handed casting or single handed rods are required. Simms waders & boots are available for all sizes.",
