    "description": "Fly Fishing From Whistler, Squamish, Vancouver &amp; Pemberton, B.C. Welcome to Valley Fishing Guides located in Squamish, British Columbia. Squamish is just a 45 minute drive north of Vancouver and 45 minutes south of Whistler. For 25 years our fly fishing guides have specialized in remote wilderness fly fishing trips in Squamish and Whistler BC. Come fish with the original ... Read More",
